        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n6. Clause 2.4.3 of the Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011 is as under:\n\"2.4.3: Action by Designated Officer on the report of Food Analyst."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4e5f0bb3b0c645098c69c88ae9b682d3_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If, after considering the report, the Designated Officer is of the opinion for reason(s) to be recorded in writing, that the report delivered by the Food Analyst under Rule 2.4.2 (5) is erroneous, he shall forward one of the parts of the sa"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fdb6d06204f44d73b292e03ecae6d8a6_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As per the aforesaid rules, upon receipt of the report from the food analyst under Rule 2.4.2 '5' be designated officer has to form in opinion which has to be recorded in writing giving reasons that the report of food analyst is erroneous."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e07b41c06d4f45779afc392db65c7be6_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Thereafter, he may forward the sample to the referral laboratory for analysis."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7b3e9637229e494ab3ec94dea2ba995e_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, in the 4 WP-10527-2024 present matter the designated officer by his letter dated 19.10.2023 has only recorded that the report received from the food analyst is erroneous and unsatisfactory."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b2b726b9b26a434d9eedfad61a9d0f8e_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, opinion based reasons to be recorded in writing has not been found."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d062808c6b82497b952f5e0d535b960c_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It was imperative for him to record his reasons in writing as to why he has found an opinion that the report delivered by the food analyst is erroneous."
      },
